    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Story</h2><br>Join Arlinton on a courageous quest to save his community and unearth his destiny. In the heart of eastern Portland, Jamaica, this story revolves around Arlinton, an orphaned boy living with his Grandma. Battling financial constraints, Arlinton takes on odd jobs with his handcart to secure funds for his education. Walk alongside him as he outwits a local gang leader's grasp and discovers his true calling. As a shadow of corruption cast by a politician looms, Arlinton's journey transforms into a battle for his community's prosperity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize Handcarts</strong></h2>Tailor Arlinton's journey with unique handcart customizations that reflect his individuality and progress through the game.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/f59d0fb8ebcfe2b50d4daf707ef6670d.poster.avif?t=1714362034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/f59d0fb8ebcfe2b50d4daf707ef6670d.webm?t=1714362034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play Jamaican Mini Games!</strong></h2>Experience the vibrant culture through engaging mini-games that immerse you in the heart of Jamaican life.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/e1a590c783cf5d77829acc0ba1bdbaf7.poster.avif?t=1714362034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/e1a590c783cf5d77829acc0ba1bdbaf7.webm?t=1714362034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/e1a590c783cf5d77829acc0ba1bdbaf7.mp4?t=1714362034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Blast Enemy's Away</strong></h2>Navigate through obstacles and challenges, overcoming adversaries to secure the safety of Arlinton's community.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/03ae096c04caf1818d308f14bec47dca.poster.avif?t=1714362034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/03ae096c04caf1818d308f14bec47dca.webm?t=1714362034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Grow &amp; Sell Crops:</strong></h2>Cultivate the land, nurture crops, and contribute to the local economy by selling your bountiful harvest.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/e9c7e2cf97d1256c57c680dd38fd17d8.poster.avif?t=1714362034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/e9c7e2cf97d1256c57c680dd38fd17d8.webm?t=1714362034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/e9c7e2cf97d1256c57c680dd38fd17d8.mp4?t=1714362034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main Features</h2> </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Roam freely, take on side missions, or simply unwind on the serene beaches of the island.<br></li><li>Interact with the locals, unlocking valuable items that aid you on your journey of discovery.<br></li><li>Embark on a quest to unearth the history behind colonial artifacts, deepening your connection to the island's heritage.<br></li><li>Dive into environmental research and discover ways to preserve and protect the island's ecosystem.<br></li><li>Craft, build structures, and personalize Arlinton's attire and handcart.<br></li><li>Collect plastic, recycle, and reap significant rewards, promoting eco-awareness.<br></li><li>Immerse yourself in the island's changing climate and rhythm of life.<br></li><li>Engage in farming, cooking, and tending to animals, contributing to both sustenance and community bonding.<br></li><li>Delight in the flavors of authentic Jamaican food, adding cultural richness to your journey. <br></li><li>Immerse yourself in Jamaican-themed mini-games that encapsulate the island's spirit.</li></ul><br>Help your community, save the environment, and help Arlinton get back to school this summer in Street Boy.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Story</h2><br>Join Arlinton on a courageous quest to save his community and unearth his destiny. In the heart of eastern Portland, Jamaica, this story revolves around Arlinton, an orphaned boy living with his Grandma. Battling financial constraints, Arlinton takes on odd jobs with his handcart to secure funds for his education. Walk alongside him as he outwits a local gang leader's grasp and discovers his true calling. As a shadow of corruption cast by a politician looms, Arlinton's journey transforms into a battle for his community's prosperity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize Handcarts</strong></h2>Tailor Arlinton's journey with unique handcart customizations that reflect his individuality and progress through the game.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/f59d0fb8ebcfe2b50d4daf707ef6670d.poster.avif?t=1714362034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/f59d0fb8ebcfe2b50d4daf707ef6670d.webm?t=1714362034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play Jamaican Mini Games!</strong></h2>Experience the vibrant culture through engaging mini-games that immerse you in the heart of Jamaican life.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/e1a590c783cf5d77829acc0ba1bdbaf7.poster.avif?t=1714362034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/e1a590c783cf5d77829acc0ba1bdbaf7.webm?t=1714362034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/e1a590c783cf5d77829acc0ba1bdbaf7.mp4?t=1714362034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Blast Enemy's Away</strong></h2>Navigate through obstacles and challenges, overcoming adversaries to secure the safety of Arlinton's community.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/03ae096c04caf1818d308f14bec47dca.poster.avif?t=1714362034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/03ae096c04caf1818d308f14bec47dca.webm?t=1714362034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Grow &amp; Sell Crops:</strong></h2>Cultivate the land, nurture crops, and contribute to the local economy by selling your bountiful harvest.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/e9c7e2cf97d1256c57c680dd38fd17d8.poster.avif?t=1714362034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/e9c7e2cf97d1256c57c680dd38fd17d8.webm?t=1714362034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1663330/extras/e9c7e2cf97d1256c57c680dd38fd17d8.mp4?t=1714362034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main Features</h2> </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Roam freely, take on side missions, or simply unwind on the serene beaches of the island.<br></li><li>Interact with the locals, unlocking valuable items that aid you on your journey of discovery.<br></li><li>Embark on a quest to unearth the history behind colonial artifacts, deepening your connection to the island's heritage.<br></li><li>Dive into environmental research and discover ways to preserve and protect the island's ecosystem.<br></li><li>Craft, build structures, and personalize Arlinton's attire and handcart.<br></li><li>Collect plastic, recycle, and reap significant rewards, promoting eco-awareness.<br></li><li>Immerse yourself in the island's changing climate and rhythm of life.<br></li><li>Engage in farming, cooking, and tending to animals, contributing to both sustenance and community bonding.<br></li><li>Delight in the flavors of authentic Jamaican food, adding cultural richness to your journey. <br></li><li>Immerse yourself in Jamaican-themed mini-games that encapsulate the island's spirit.</li></ul><br>Help your community, save the environment, and help Arlinton get back to school this summer in Street Boy.",
    "short_description": "Embark on a captivating tropical adventure in Street Boy. Join Arlinton, an orphaned boy, as he races, builds, and explores his way toward a brighter future. Help him discover his true calling and make it back to school this summer.",
